  "palette Water": "<div class="flex items-end gap-2"><section class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface/95 text-fg shadow-pop pointer-events-auto flex w-[34rem] gap-2 p-2" aria-label="Architect" data-testid="architect"><div class="flex w-24 flex-col gap-0.5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Orders</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Zones</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Structure</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Furniture</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Production</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Storage</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Lighting</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold bg-accent-soft text-fg">Water</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Misc</button></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap content-start gap-1.5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Click a cell: one still water source (indoors too)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-droplet size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5C6 11.1 5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Water source</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Drag a line or an area: every cell a source (a canal, a hydroponic tray)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-waves-horizontal lucide-waves size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12q2.5 2 5 0t5 0 5 0 5 0"></path><path d="M2 19q2.5 2 5 0t5 0 5 0 5 0"></path><path d="M2 5q2.5 2 5 0t5 0 5 0 5 0"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Water channel</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Click a corner: a 2×2 pool that refills (pawns fill their buckets there)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-droplets size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 16.3c2.2 0 4-1.83 4-4.05 0-1.16-.57-2.26-1.71-3.19S7.29 6.75 7 5.3c-.29 1.45-1.14 2.84-2.29 3.76S3 11.1 3 12.25c0 2.22 1.8 4.05 4 4.05z"></path><path d="M12.56 6.6A10.97 10.97 0 0 0 14 3.02c.5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5s3 3.5 3 5.5a6.98 6.98 0 0 1-11.91 4.97"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Infinite source</span></button><p class="w-56 text-[11px] leading-snug text-muted" data-testid="water-note">Pawns bring a bucket (3 iron ingots at a crafting table), fill it at still water and pour each cell. Dig the trench first for a canal; a 2×2 infinite source refills.</p></div></section><section class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface/95 text-fg shadow-pop pointer-events-auto max-h-[46vh] w-[22rem] overflow-auto p-2" aria-label="Placeables" data-testid="architect-palette"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1"><button type="button" data-entry="water_source" data-tier="workbench" data-unlocked="true" title="Made: craft Bucket from Iron Ingot (table)" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-1.5 py-1 text-left text-[11px] border-border bg-surface-2 hover:border-border-strong"><span class="inline-grid shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-surface-3 text-[9px] font-semibold text-muted" style="width: 20px; height: 20px;" title="Item 326" aria-label="Item 326">It</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate font-semibold"><span class="truncate">Water source</span></span><span class="block truncate text-[10px] text-muted">Workbench · short: 3 iron ingot</span></span></button><button type="button" data-entry="water_channel" data-tier="workbench" data-unlocked="true" title="Made: craft Bucket from Iron Ingot (table)" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-1.5 py-1 text-left text-[11px] border-border bg-surface-2 hover:border-border-strong"><span class="inline-grid shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-surface-3 text-[9px] font-semibold text-muted" style="width: 20px; height: 20px;" title="Item 326" aria-label="Item 326">It</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate font-semibold"><span class="truncate">Water channel</span></span><span class="block truncate text-[10px] text-muted">Workbench · short: 3 iron ingot</span></span></button><button type="button" data-entry="infinite_water" data-tier="workbench" data-unlocked="true" title="Made: craft Bucket from Iron Ingot (table)" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-1.5 py-1 text-left text-[11px] border-border bg-surface-2 hover:border-border-strong"><span class="inline-grid shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-surface-3 text-[9px] font-semibold text-muted" style="width: 20px; height: 20px;" title="Item 326" aria-label="Item 326">It</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate font-semibold"><span class="truncate">Infinite water source</span></span><span class="block truncate text-[10px] text-muted">Workbench · short: 3 iron ingot</span></span></button></div></section></div>",
  "palette Zones": "<div class="flex items-end gap-2"><section class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface/95 text-fg shadow-pop pointer-events-auto flex w-[34rem] gap-2 p-2" aria-label="Architect" data-testid="architect"><div class="flex w-24 flex-col gap-0.5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Orders</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold bg-accent-soft text-fg">Zones</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Structure</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Furniture</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Production</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Storage</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Lighting</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Water</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Misc</button></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap content-start gap-1.5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Pawns plant, tend and harvest here (replaces other work zones)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Growing zone</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Trees here are cut and replanted (replaces other work zones)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Woodlot</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Pawns dig everything down to bedrock (a spiral stair), or only the ores (replaces other work zones)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Quarry</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Pawns fish here with rods (still water only) (replaces other work zones)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Fishing zone</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Where pawns rest and keep things tidy (an overlay layer)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Home area</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Available pawns with Guard enabled attack visible mobs here, including animals; players are excluded (an overlay layer)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Guard</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Pawns never walk here (an overlay layer)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Keep out</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Loot goes here while the colony has no storage (an overlay layer)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Drop spot</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Pawns keep these blocks as they are and repair any change (an overlay layer)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-dashed lucide-box-select size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2"></path><path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2"></path><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path><path d="M5 21a2 2 0 0 1-2-2"></path><path d="M9 3h1"></path><path d="M9 21h1"></path><path d="M14 3h1"></path><path d="M14 21h1"></path><path d="M3 9v1"></path><path d="M21 9v1"></path><path d="M3 14v1"></path><path d="M21 14v1"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Preserve</span></button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Drag over zones to erase those cells (empty zones go, a zone cut in two becomes two)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x size-4 size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg><span class="text-center">Erase zone</span></button><p class="w-full text-[11px] leading-snug text-muted">Drag to paint. Cells touching a zone of the same type join it; work zones replace each other; Home area, Keep out, Guard, Drop spot and Preserve are overlay layers. Shift-drag from inside a zone extends that zone.</p></div></section></div>",
}
`;

exports[`ArchitectPanel > opens on the tool’s category 1`] = `
{
  "bed": "<div class="flex items-end gap-2"><section class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface/95 text-fg shadow-pop pointer-events-auto flex w-[34rem] gap-2 p-2" aria-label="Architect" data-testid="architect"><div class="flex w-24 flex-col gap-0.5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Orders</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Zones</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Structure</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold bg-accent-soft text-fg">Furniture</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Production</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Storage</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Lighting</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Water</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="rounded px-2 py-1.5 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-muted hover:bg-surface-2">Misc</button></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-wrap content-start gap-1.5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Place a crafting table (Q/E turns)" class="relative flex h-[62px] w-[74px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md border text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium border-border bg-surface-2 text-muted hover:border-border-strong hover:text-fg"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strok